      "id": 445122,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "An authorization bypass issue was identified and subsequently remediated in the `FetchMemberships` GraphQL operation. This issue had allowed individuals no longer associated with the organization to access sensitive team member data due to inadequate validation of user permissions. The information that was potentially accessible included names, email addresses, roles, and IDs of current team members.",
